# Samakan akhir baris agar tidak muncul peringatan LF/CRLF dan diff palsu di Windows.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.blade.php diff=html
*.css diff=css
*.md diff=markdown
*.php diff=php

# Berkas biner
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.woff2 binary
*.zip binary

/.github export-ignore
CHANGELOG.md export-ignore
